window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Wyatt thought Avery was the root of all problems. He thought wrong.</b></p> <p>A shocking revelation has torn the Shadowed Souls apart, splintering them from within. Now fractured and facing unseen dangers, the remaining members are forced to make an impossible choice: search for Wyatt, their self-destructive leader, or protect the feisty ballet dancer they've all come to cherish, Avery.</p> <p>Avery swept into their lives and captured their hearts, becoming the embodiment of everything these damaged men have always craved—a love to hold on to, a family to call their own. But as evil lurks in the shadows and emotions spiral out of control, loyalties will be tested. Who will thrive, and who will fall apart? One thing is certain. Nixon has a lot to answer for.</p>"; 
